+## Failed session initialization
+
+- When `beforeSession` throws an `Error`, the orchestrator awaits `onError(session, error)` and then `afterSession(session)` before rejecting with the original error, provided those hooks complete normally; no user-input or model processing has run, and cleanup receives the same session with any partial initialization left by `beforeSession`, so deployers must track their own allocations and tolerate an incomplete start ([validated by: reports and cleans up a failed beforeSession before rejecting with the original error](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.acceptance.test.ts#L8)).
